The one issue I have with Argent is that his promo power is just about flat out better than vocalize.&nbsp;Think about it. Most of his best abilities come from the accompany&#39;s of cards. Plus an extra free card play? That&#39;s nuts when chained with his normal 1 instrument/2 song setup.&nbsp;I don&#39;t feel like it adds a new way to look at the deck. It&#39;s more the difference between tachyons Innate and Reaserch Grant to me. I&#39;d really like to hear what I&#39;m not seeing though. I have to be missing something.&nbsp;

[/quote]

Hmm.

There are three of the Argent&#39;s songs that have no accompany text, and multiple others where the perform requires you to have a specific instrument. &nbsp;

With vocalize, you could always rely on being able to do something- not necessarily one of the big chains, but you could always make use of part of each power, since all of them have a perform. &nbsp;With the new one, you have to be more reliant on the instruments.

